<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'44px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'126px', justifyContent:'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:13, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5', letterSpacing:1.6 }}>03 · 진행 점검</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:40, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:10, lineHeight:1.1 }}>계획 대비 현재 위치 — W9, 어디까지 왔나</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:18, color:'#64748B', marginTop:8 }}>執行方案 15주 일정과 대조</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'1px', background:'#E3EAF2' }} />

  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'440px', marginTop:'18px', flexDirection:'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', flexDirection:'row', gap:10 }}>
      <Box style={{ width:230, background:'#E9F5F0', borderRadius:12, padding:'16px 14px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56' }}>W1–2</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>조사 · 계획서</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56', marginTop:8 }}>완료</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:230, background:'#E9F5F0', borderRadius:12, padding:'16px 14px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56' }}>W3–5</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>기획 · 도면</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56', marginTop:8 }}>완료</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:230, background:'#E9F5F0', borderRadius:12, padding:'16px 14px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56' }}>W6–7</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>골격</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56', marginTop:8 }}>완료</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:230, background:'#FBF3E5', borderRadius:12, padding:'16px 14px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A06A00' }}>W8–11</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>핵심 loop</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A06A00', marginTop:8 }}>W6 선완료</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:230, background:'#F1F5F9', borderRadius:12, padding:'16px 14px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#64748B' }}>W12–15</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:8 }}>검증 · 발표</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:12.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#64748B', marginTop:8 }}>예정</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize:13.5, color:'#A06A00', fontWeight:'bold', marginTop:14 }}>▲ 현재 W9 (10/26) — 계획상 '핵심 loop 진행 중', 실제는 W6에 완료</Text>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', flexDirection:'row', gap:14, marginTop:14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width:385, background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:25, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5' }}>3주</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:2 }}>계획 대비 선행</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:13, color:'#64748B', marginTop:2 }}>핵심 loop를 W6에 완료</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:385, background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:25, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5' }}>5탭</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:2 }}>구현 완성</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:13, color:'#64748B', marginTop:2 }}>마이룸·공작소·상점·우편함·리포트</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width:385, background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'14px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:25, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5' }}>0명</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:2 }}>남은 것 = 실사용자</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:13, color:'#64748B', marginTop:2 }}>W9–11 모집 후 W13 검증</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', background:'#EDF4FC', borderRadius:12, padding:'14px 20px', marginTop:14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:15.5, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5' }}>중간발표에서 보여줄 것 = 계획상 W8까지의 산출물</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:14.5, color:'#33475B', marginTop:4 }}>조사 → 기획 → 도면 → DB 설계 → 동작하는 핵심 화면. 3D 아트는 범위에서 제외했습니다.</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'28px', marginTop:12, flexDirection:'row', justifyContent:'space-between', alignItems:'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:12, color:'#94A3B8' }}>㈜도로 × 한양대 ERICA IC-PBL · 루미(RooMi)</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:12, color:'#94A3B8' }}>11 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>